'''にゃんこ大戦争 攻略アイテムBOOK''' (''Nyanko Daisensō Kōryaku Aitemu BOOK'', '''Nyanko Great War Strategy Item BOOK''') is a Japanese manga that was published on March 12th, 2015 by [[wikipedia:Takarajimasha|Takarajimasha]].

