==Contents==
Here comes the strategy item BOOK of "The Great Cat War" which is also popular in LINE stamp.<br>
The game is easy to play, even for the first time, with an easy-to-understand start guide.<br>
This book will help you achieve your ambition of conquering the whole country with your army of cute cats.<br>
We'll help you with tactics, training and more.<br>
The game also features a wide range of enemies with their own unique personalities.<br>
This book is the perfect companion to "The Great Cat War".<br>
This book also includes a limited edition downloadable bonus "Large! Cat Masigura Set" is included!

Super luxury download privilege 【Large! Cat Masigura Set】 included!!
*Cat Ticket x 5
*Rare Ticket x 1
*[[Cat Food]] x 30

